<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/badlands.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/badlands-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/badlands.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="799" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span aria-current="page">Across North Dakota</span></nav><p class="kicker">Statewide coverage</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Across All 53 North Dakota Counties</h1><p class="lede">North Dakota Insurance Appraiser works statewide — from the Red River to the badlands and from the Canadian border to the South Dakota line. These local pages cover the cities where we handle claims most often.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/request-an-appraisal/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="lcards" data-stagger><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/fargo/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fargo-depot.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fargo-depot-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fargo-depot.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Fargo</h2><small>Cass County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/west-fargo/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">West Fargo</h2><small>Cass County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/bismarck/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bismarck-depot.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bismarck-depot-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bismarck-depot.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="743" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Bismarck</h2><small>Burleigh County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/mandan/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/supercell.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/supercell-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/supercell.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="658" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Mandan</h2><small>Morton County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/grand-forks/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/grand-forks-flood.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/grand-forks-flood-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/grand-forks-flood.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="788" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Grand Forks</h2><small>Grand Forks County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/minot/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/minot-old-main.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/minot-old-main-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/minot-old-main.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Minot</h2><small>Ward County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/williston/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/williston-store.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/williston-store-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/williston-store.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="739" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Williston</h2><small>Williams County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/dickinson/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/badlands2.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/badlands2-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/badlands2.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="783" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Dickinson</h2><small>Stark County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/jamestown/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/arvilla-winter.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/arvilla-winter-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/arvilla-winter.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Jamestown</h2><small>Stutsman County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/wahpeton/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/barn-rural.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/barn-rural-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/barn-rural.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Wahpeton</h2><small>Richland County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/devils-lake/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/devils-lake-winter.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/devils-lake-winter-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/devils-lake-winter.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Devils Lake</h2><small>Ramsey County</small></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/across-north-dakota/valley-city/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/valley-city-bridge.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/valley-city-bridge-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/valley-city-bridge.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 280px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="lcard-t"><h2 class="lcard-h">Valley City</h2><small>Barnes County</small></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head rv"><p class="label"><span>5</span>Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across North Dakota</h2><p>The same policy language plays out very differently on a Fargo two-story, a Minot rebuild and a ranch shop near Dickinson.</p></div><div class="regrows" data-stagger><div class="regrow rv"><div class="regrow-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fargo-depot.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fargo-depot-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fargo-depot.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 320px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>Red River Valley</h3><p class="region-c">Fargo · West Fargo · Grand Forks · Wahpeton</p><p>The flattest, most populated corner of the state. Severe summer storms track straight across the valley, and snowmelt years bring sump, foundation and sewer-backup questions — many of them coverage issues, not appraisal issues.</p><ul class="chips"><li>Large hail</li><li>Spring flooding</li><li>Straight-line wind</li><li>Basement water</li></ul></div></div><div class="regrow rv"><div class="regrow-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/valley-city-bridge.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/valley-city-bridge-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/valley-city-bridge.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 320px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>Lakes &amp; Drift Prairie</h3><p class="region-c">Devils Lake · Jamestown · Valley City</p><p>Small cities, farmsteads and lake homes spread across the prairie. Claims here often mix a house, a detached garage and an outbuilding or two — and adjusters can be days away after a big storm.</p><ul class="chips"><li>Hail on siding</li><li>Ice dams</li><li>Blizzards</li><li>Wind</li></ul></div></div><div class="regrow rv"><div class="regrow-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bismarck-depot.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bismarck-depot-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bismarck-depot.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 320px" width="1200" height="743" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>Capital Corridor</h3><p class="region-c">Bismarck · Mandan</p><p>The capital region sits where the Heart River meets the Missouri River. Older homes near downtown, fast-growing subdivisions on the edges and a commercial core produce a wide mix of roof, siding and interior claims.</p><ul class="chips"><li>Hail</li><li>River ice &amp; high water</li><li>Snow load</li><li>Fire</li></ul></div></div><div class="regrow rv"><div class="regrow-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/minot-old-main.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/minot-old-main-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/minot-old-main.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 320px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>Northwest &amp; Bakken</h3><p class="region-c">Minot · Williston</p><p>From the Souris River valley to the oil patch. Rapid growth added apartments, workforce housing and steel commercial buildings — construction types that each price differently in an estimate.</p><ul class="chips"><li>Wind</li><li>Frozen pipes</li><li>Hail</li><li>Flood aftermath</li></ul></div></div><div class="regrow rv"><div class="regrow-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/badlands.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/badlands-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/badlands.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 320px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>Southwest &amp; Badlands</h3><p class="region-c">Dickinson · Medora</p><p>Open rangeland, ranch buildings and oil-country towns. Dry, windy autumns raise grass-fire exposure, and long distances make careful documentation more important than ever.</p><ul class="chips"><li>Grass fire</li><li>Wind</li><li>Hail</li><li>Extreme cold</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>Don’t see your town?</h2><p>We cover every county. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-navy" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ink-line" href="/request-an-appraisal/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
